Feelime

Feelime uses sherpa-onnx and pretrained models published by the k2-fsa
project. Their source repositories and model documentation contain the
applicable notices and licenses.

Built-in offline translation (zh<->en)
  - slimt-sys / slimt inference engine (MIT): https://github.com/DavidVentura/slimt-sys
  - Translation models from Mozilla Firefox Translations (bergamot), MPL-2.0
    https://github.com/mozilla/firefox-translations-models
